rows.abstract:
Aims to employ the proper application of technology to address several issues faced by many Filipinos living in dense metropolitan areas; 
Intends to create a developmental, standardization, and incentivization framework for local government units to spur the creation of Smart Cities nationwide - while respecting the principle of local autonomy;
Provides that the term \"smart city\" denotes an \"instrumented, interconnected and intelligent city\" whereas \"instrumented\" refers to the capability of capturing and integrating live real-world data through the use of sensors, meters, appliances, personal devices, and other similar sensors;
Provides an incentivazation program called Smart Innovation and City Acceleration Program or S I C A P.
